  "title": "The Agentic Era Demands a New Class of Infrastructure: DigitalOcean Acquires Katanemo Labs",
  "summary": "DigitalOcean acquired Katanemo Labs to help developers move AI agents from prototype to production with less infrastructure overhead. By integrating Katanemo Lab’s Plano data plane and observability capabilities, teams can rely on built-in orchestration, execution, and monitoring instead of stitching together their own stack. The result is a more straightforward way to build, deploy, and run agent-based applications at scale.",
